<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2PE" style="id">- LYN.62 USFM K.KACHINDA NT 2 PETER</book>
  <para style="h">2 PITOLOSI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Elin̄olo lya Pitololosi no Wiili</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Pit</para>
  <para style="mt2">ELIN̄OLO NO WIILI LYA</para>
  <para style="mt1">PITOLOSI</para>
  <para style="imt">OKULIMUKISA</para>
  <para style="iot">Elin̄olo lya Pitolosi no wiili kame limonisa nji kame lina kun̄oliwa kwa mutumiwa Pitolosi, kono asikukwiyeta balelo lino kapumene nji niti. Kame kotobile nji omunjili kame ana kun̄ola elin̄olo eli musibaka sa Pitolosi. Omun̄oli kame aamba nji kame apaka na kumona ni miyo aye mukuyoya kwa Jesu mane onene kame aamba ba kufutuka kwaye (1.17-18). Nji Pitolosi nakun̄ola elin̄olo mwendi kame ana kulin̄ola yoli mu Loma mukaci ka myaka no 65 okutwala ba 69 munyima no kuleiwa kwa Kilesite, yoka sifa kale. Pitolosi kame aisana elin̄olo lyaye eli ngeso nji lya wiili (3.1) okubeeka enako no kun̄ola munyima no lin̄olo lya Pitolosi no weeli. Kame ana kulimukisa elin̄olo eli kwa sikupumena kwa Nyambe onje.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pitolosi nakun̄ola elin̄olo eli mulibaka no kususuweza asikupumena nji ayoye omuyoyelo no kuwaba nikwa laela nji alese okukon̄a aiyeti no mapwa (2). Kame aasusuweza nji alimbulule aanu awo aamba nji Jesu kame aliyeha okuuka. Okubita nji ayuleke nji Nyambe kakatabile kono kame asinga nji omunu yonje ayoyisiwe (2 Pitolosi 3.8-9). Eli elibaka no kuyoya omuyoyelo no kuwaba (3.14).</para>
  <para style="ip">Emitwi no Yambo 1. Pitolosi kame akulimukisa yonyene ni kusimweta asikubala aye (1.1-2). 2. Cwale kame aapulukisa nji ayoye omuyoyelo no kuwaba kakuli Nyambe natu twesisa okutenda ngeso (1.3-21). 3. Esi sitatamako neli okwaba emamela kweyi no aiyeti no mapwa mane ni kwaamba eyo saitendahale kwa iyeti no mapwa ku mamaneneno (2. 1-22). 4. Munyima nweyo Pitolosi kame asususweza asikupumena okuyoya omuyoyelo no kuwaba okutukiseta Jesu okwiiya aka no wiili (3. 1-17).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 1:1"/>Okutunda kwa Simoni Pitolosi, omubika ni mutumiwa wa Jesu Kilesite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 1:1">Kwawo ana wana etumelo eyo ikufekile naaci mu kuluka mwa Nyambe wetu ni muyoyisi Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="2PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 1:2"/>Esishemo ni kozo yekeziwe kwanyi mu zibo yenu ya Nyambe ni Jesu ombumu wetu.<verse eid="2PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Eketo ni Kwisana kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 1:3"/>Amaata aye natubi einu yonje no moyo ni ya Nyambe, mukulimuka kwaye woyo ona kutwisana ku kanya yaye mane ni kuuwa, <verse eid="2PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 1:4"/>mulibakaelyo Nyambe natubi utokwa waye ni sepiso inene, nji mu inu eyi mubanduke ku ulyangelino owo uli mu litunga mulibaka no titakazo ni kufutuka atendi no inu no unyambe. <verse eid="2PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 1:5"/>Kakuli mu libaka eli mweteke onene okwekeza ku tumelo yenu ouwa ni kuuwa wenu ezibo <verse eid="2PE 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 1:6"/>ni ku zibo mwekeze oukulema, ni ukulema mwekeze okoongola, ni kukoongota mwekeze ou nyambe. <verse eid="2PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 1:7"/>mi ounyambe ni umweya mane oumweya mwekeze oukusinga. <verse eid="2PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 1:8"/>Kakuli nji einu eyi niyenu mi kame ili kwaanyi, kame imitenda nji mulese okuzwafa simba okwabeeka embuya mu zibo ya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="2PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 1:9"/>Kakuli yonje woyo oulwile einu eyi kame ali esibofu mi kamono mane na pulama nji naku kenisiwa ku ibi yaye no kale. <verse eid="2PE 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 1:10"/>Cwalehe abaange, mukoongote onene mukulimuka okwisaniwa ni kuketiwa kwenu kakuli nji kame mutenda eyi kamutamba okukwa. <verse eid="2PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 1:11"/>Cwale kame sa mubiwe esifumu no kupula no kwingena mu Mubuso wa Mbumu ni muyoyisi wetu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="2PE 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 1:12"/>Cwalehe kame sani mipulukisange enako yonje einu eyi naba muilimukile mi kame ili mu niti eyo mukwite. <verse eid="2PE 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 1:13"/>Kame ninahana nji kame kuli wino onene aba nili mu lutu olu okumiingula mu mukwa no ku mipulukisa. <verse eid="2PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 1:14"/>Kakuli kame niyii nji okutubula olutu lwange kame kuli beebi kanyi eso ana ku ni monisa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu. <verse eid="2PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 1:15"/>Cwale kame sanimone nji munyima yange mbamutwese mu nako yonje okupuluka einu eyi.<verse eid="2PE 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Oupaki no Kanya ya Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 1:16"/>Kakuli katusikukon̄a okushangama no inu no matangu aba tuna kumi limukisa amaata ni kwiiya kwa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. Kono kame tuli apaki no kuneneba kwaye. <verse eid="2PE 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 1:17"/>Kakuli aba ana kutambula elikute ni kanya okutunda kwa Nyambe sitetu mi eliywi kame linatundu kwa yonyene mulibaka no kanya inene okwamba nji, “Wuyu nimwanange ni singa, woyo oni wabelisa!” <verse eid="2PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 1:18"/>Kame tuna kuyupa eliywi lina kutunda ku wilu kakuli kame tuna kwikala naye ba lilundu no kukena. <verse eid="2PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 1:19"/>Cwale kame tuli ni liywi no unuhi no niti. Cwale kame samutende wino kanyi elambi itumbuka mu sibaka no uwi okutunda amangolwaa okutwala amasiku mi olutungweti no masiku olubenya mu micima yenu. <verse eid="2PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 1:20"/>Oweli muyupisise eyi, nji kakwisa ounuhi no man̄olo wambiwa okutunda ku munu yonyene feela. <verse eid="2PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 1:21"/>Kakuli kakwisa ounuhi onakwiiya mulibaka no unu, kono aanu kame anakunyanganya ni Mebo no Kukena ina kwambiwa okutunda kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="2PE 1:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2PE 2"/>
  <para style="s">Aiyeti no Mapwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 2:1"/>Kono anuhi no mapwa mane kame amonahala mukaci no aanu, kanyi aba sakwikale aiyeti no mapwa mukaci kenu. Kame salite ku mukunda eyi samuyupe eyi isinya, simba okukana Omolyoo ona kwaula mi kame sakusinye onyene. <verse eid="2PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 2:2"/>Cwale anokupula kame sakon̄e ouyi woo, mi mulibaka lyoo endila no niti kame saisinyehe. <verse eid="2PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 2:3"/>Cwale mu ulyangelino woo kame sa myoonge ni maywi oo no mapwa, kakuli okutunda kunyima okunyaziwa koo ku sibitelele, mi okusinyeha koo kakukoso! <verse eid="2PE 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 2:4"/>Kakuli nji Nyambe kasi kushemuba amangeloi aba ana kufosa, kono kame ana kwanunga ni kwayumbela mu mukoti no uwi mu lihele okuteuliwamo okutwala ba nako no katulo. <verse eid="2PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 2:5"/>Nyambe kasi kushemuba elitunga no kale, kono nakuyoyisa Nuwe, yonyene ona kwamba eyi no kuluka nanjili aanu noku kwana mutanu ni twiili, aba ana kulita omuunda mu litunga no anyefuli. <verse eid="2PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 2:6"/>Nyambe muku futula emilenen̄e no Sodoma ni Gomola okwiitenda omute kame ana kwaatula ni kwatenda omwanda kwaawo sanyefule. <verse eid="2PE 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 2:7"/>Nyambe kame ana kuyoyisa Loti no kuluka, ona kweenanga onene mulibaka no oyi no aanu no kufokola. <verse eid="2PE 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 2:8"/>Kakuli mulibaka no inu eyo ana kumonanga nikuyupanga woyo mulume nokuluka omo ana kuyoyelanga mukaci koo, kame ana kuyupanga okukola mu moyo waye no kuluka mu liywaa ni liywaa mulibaka no misebezi yoo no kwiiba. <verse eid="2PE 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 2:9"/>Cwale Ombumu kame ayii omo no kuyoyiseta aasikupumena okutunda mu miliko ni kuteula awo no kwaluka munji no koto okutwala ba liywaa no katulo, <verse eid="2PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 2:10"/>onene awo ata mu titakazo too no uyii ni kushwaula etukelo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2PE 2:10">Aanu aa kame akukuhumusa ni koongola emicima, mi kacili okunyefula awo no kukanya. <verse eid="2PE 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 2:11"/>Simba amangeloi naba ali ano kuneneba ni maata kaatoyo ni katulo eyo anyefula balubala lwa Mbumu. <verse eid="2PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 2:12"/>Kono aanu aa kabiti eiyamana nambulwa etingana, eyo ileyelwa okulemiwa ni kwibaiwa awo akwingenyeka mu titaba no kwalimukiwa, kame sasinyiwe mu sinyeho imweya nonyene, <verse eid="2PE 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 2:13"/>kame sayande mulibaka no misebezi yoo no kwiiba. Kame aibala nji mwelembo okumonahala omunji okutenda enokwiiba. Kame aenisa ni kunyazahala, kame amonahala mu koonga koo aba alya naanyi.<verse eid="2PE 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 2:14"/>Kame akwite amiyo aiyalile ohule ni nyolelo no kutenda esibi. Kame akomanga emyoyo no kwaongola. Kame akwite emicima iyetelwe mu ulyangelino mi kame ali aana no sikuto! <verse eid="2PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 2:15"/>Kame ana tundu mundila no kuluka ni kuyauluka, kame ana kon̄o endila ya Balami omwana Beole, woyo ona kusinga okuwana einu no kwiiba, <verse eid="2PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 2:16"/>kono kame ana kukalimelwa mulibaka no uyi waye. Embongolo sebeli yaamba okutusisa eliywi no unu ni kumana olweelo no munuhi. <verse eid="2PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 2:17"/>Aa aanu kame akufekile kanyi eliweluwelu no kukuta ameyi ni makumbi aendisiwa ku mebo no lin̄ungwa, kakuli onyene kame atewelwe esibaka no ouwi. <verse eid="2PE 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 2:18"/>Kakuli kame aamba mukukuwa oukuyeema eyi no weelo, kame akutusisa etitakazo no unu ni uhule aanu anamana okubanduka kwawo ayoya mu mafosisa. <verse eid="2PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2PE 2:19"/>Kame asepisiwa okwalukulula kono onyene kame ali abika no inu no ulyangelino, kakuli kweyo yonje iiya eyo ikoma omunu kumubeeka mu ubika. <verse eid="2PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2PE 2:20"/>Kakuli nji munyima no kubanduka ouwi no litunga kubitela mu kulimuka kwa Nyambe ni muyoyisi wetu Jesu Kilesite, asinungilwe kame kweyo mane ni kukomiwa, amamaneneno oo kame saibe onene okubita ba weli. <verse eid="2PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2PE 2:21"/>Kakuli kwakuwaba kwa onyene kambe kasikulimuka endila no kuluka, kubita nji aba ana mana okulika atunda mu titaelo no kuluka ana kubiwa. <verse eid="2PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2PE 2:22"/>Kame ina tendahala kwa onyene okukumanena ku nguli no niti eyi yaamba nji, Ombwa kame aukela kweyo ana lusu” mi “Ongulube ona yowisiwa osita kame okakuyowa mu ndowa.”<verse eid="2PE 2:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2PE 3"/>
  <para style="s">Esepiso no Kwiiya kwa Mbumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2PE 3:1"/>Eli cwale elin̄olo no wiili elyo inami n̄olele. Asingiwa mi mu man̄olo ayiili kame ina mipulukisa nji mulese okupulama mu minahano yenu, <verse eid="2PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2PE 3:2"/>nji cwale mupuluke ana kunuha anuhi no kukena ni titaelo ta Mbumu ni Muyoyisi okubitela mwa tumiwa enu. <verse eid="2PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2PE 3:3"/>Oweli aanyi kame mufanena okuyupisisa eyi nji aongi kame saiye mu maywaa no mamaneneno okukon̄a etitakazo too <verse eid="2PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2PE 3:4"/>ni kwamba nji, “Kubine ili esepiso no kwiiya kwaye? Kakuli okutunda aba ana kufela anjekulyetu, einu yonje kame yekeza okutunda ku matatekelo no litunga!” <verse eid="2PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2PE 3:5"/>Kame akulyanganisa fela eniti eyi nji mulibaka no liywi lya Nyambe eliwilu kwalina kwikalanga okutunda ku kale mi elitunga kame lina kuumbiwa okutunda ba meyi mane kame lina umbiwa ba meyi, <verse eid="2PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2PE 3:6"/>mulibaka elyo elitunga lina kwikalako naliku miniwa ku meyi ni kubwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2PE 3:7"/>Kono mu liywi limweya eliwilu ni litunga eyo iliko kame itewelwe omulilo, owo utewelwe okutwala ba liywaa no katulo ni kusinya aanu no kwapumena kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="2PE 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2PE 3:8"/>Asingiwa, kono mulese okupulama eniti eyi! nji cwale kwa Nyambe eliywaa limweya kame likufekile kanyi emyaka no kukwana esikiti, mane emyaka no kukwana esikiti kame ifekile kanyi eliywaa limweya. <verse eid="2PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2PE 3:9"/>Ombumu kaliyehisa etisepiso taye kanyi omo aambela aanu nji naliyehe, kono kame afela amakeke kakuli kasingi nji aanu asinyehe kono nji aanu onje akeele ba kubaka. <verse eid="2PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2PE 3:10"/>Kono eliywaa lya Mbumu kame saliiye kanyi ombuyi mi cwale eliwilu kame salibwe ni liywi no kuneneba, mi einu ilimo kame saishengununwe ku mulilo, cwale elitunga ni misebezi yalyo mba icin̄iwa. <verse eid="2PE 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2PE 3:11"/>Kakuli eyi inu yonje mba isinyehe, cwale aanyi muli aanu no ngasibine? kame mufanena okuyoya mu kukena ni muu Nyambe. <verse eid="2PE 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2PE 3:12"/>mutatelele me mulubisa okwiiya no liywaa lya Nyambe, kakuli eliwilu kame sali shengununwe ni kusinyeha mane einu yonje ilimo mba ishengununwa ku mulilo! <verse eid="2PE 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2PE 3:13"/>Kono okukumanena ni sepiso yaye tu tatelele eliwilu ni litunga no ubya elyo okuluka saku kaikale. <verse eid="2PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2PE 3:14"/>Cwalehe, asingiwa, kakuli kame mutatelela eyi moongole nji muwaniwe kwa yonyene me muulwile esi sinyazahala mwaanyi ni kuyoya mu kozo. <verse eid="2PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2PE 3:15"/>Cwale mulemuhe nji okutatelela kwa Mbumu wetu okuyoyisiwa no aanu, mi ni yonyene Paulusi omwabetu osingiwa kame ana min̄olele okukumanena ku kushangama ana biwi. <verse eid="2PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2PE 3:16"/>Okwamba eyi kanyi omo atendela mu man̄olo aye. Kweeli einu injili iliko eyo no kubambaba okwiyupisisa eyo aanu aulwile ezibo ni kwakonda kame afutula okuwaneka ku kusinyeha koo, kanyi omo atendela mu man̄olo anjili. <verse eid="2PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2PE 3:17"/>Asingiwa, cwalehe anyi mulimukelele oweli eyi, mumamele nji mulese okuyauluka ni mafosisa no aanu no kwakonda ni taukelwa okoongola kwetu. <verse eid="2PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2PE 3:18"/>Kono mukulele mu sishemo ni zibo ya Mbumu ni Muyoyisi wetu Jesu Kilesite. Kwa yonyene kwikale ekanya bano mane ni kuta oko no kwaabwa! Amen.<verse eid="2PE 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2PE 3"/>
</usx>
